## API reference

The same as [Dialog](<%= page_path(:dialog) %>): `AlertDialog(default_open:, dismissible: false)`,
`AlertDialogTrigger`, `AlertDialogContent(close_button: false, backdrop:, frame:)`, `AlertDialogHeader`,
`AlertDialogTitle`, `AlertDialogDescription`, `AlertDialogBody`, `AlertDialogFooter`, `AlertDialogClose`. Events are
`ui--dialog:*`.

## Accessibility

- `role="alertdialog"`, labelled by the title and described by the description; focus is trapped and returns to the
  trigger.
